00:10:28,180 --> 00:10:36,260
But almost half of Jesus' parables have to do with teaching his discipleships, stewarding their resources.

139
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:47,460
Half of Jesus' teachings were about him sharing with the disciples about stewarding their resources.

140
00:10:47,460 --> 00:10:56,020
That's wild that he was having to teach them over and over and over again.

141
